        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the abrupt death of your mentor, you have become the sole proprietor of an alchemy shop in a world of magic and bizarre creatures. You will quickly learn to fill his shoes. Experiment with precise combinations of plants and minerals to learn the principles and the systems of the alchemical sciences. Use the knowledge you gain to produce the elixirs requested of you by a diverse set of creatures, monsters, and who-knows-whats. Will your arts surpass those of your mentor, allowing you to succeed where he failed?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy isn't a simple matter of combining the correct ingredients. Ratios matter, and there are multiple paths to a final result. With a deeper understanding, identify what went wrong and improvise to bring an elixir back on track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041890/extras/3a7c185442b9929c2afba738476a1ca1.poster.avif?t=1762798752\" width=716 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041890/extras/3a7c185442b9929c2afba738476a1ca1.webm?t=1762798752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041890/extras/3a7c185442b9929c2afba738476a1ca1.mp4?t=1762798752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the mouse is necessary to manipulate ingredients, containers, and tools. Carefully pour a tiny drizzle of liquid to reach a precise ratio, or quickly mash a root to harvest its essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041890/extras/ee100c242e8712f709e5b027066d404d.poster.avif?t=1762798752\" aria-label=\"A viewing port in a wooden door opens to reveal a creature with a lot of eyeballs.\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041890/extras/ee100c242e8712f709e5b027066d404d.webm?t=1762798752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the abrupt death of your mentor, you have become the sole proprietor of an alchemy shop in a world of magic and bizarre creatures. You will quickly learn to fill his shoes. Experiment with precise combinations of plants and minerals to learn the principles and the systems of the alchemical sciences. Use the knowledge you gain to produce the elixirs requested of you by a diverse set of creatures, monsters, and who-knows-whats. Will your arts surpass those of your mentor, allowing you to succeed where he failed?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy isn't a simple matter of combining the correct ingredients. Ratios matter, and there are multiple paths to a final result. With a deeper understanding, identify what went wrong and improvise to bring an elixir back on track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041890/extras/3a7c185442b9929c2afba738476a1ca1.poster.avif?t=1762798752\" width=716 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041890/extras/3a7c185442b9929c2afba738476a1ca1.webm?t=1762798752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041890/extras/3a7c185442b9929c2afba738476a1ca1.mp4?t=1762798752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the mouse is necessary to manipulate ingredients, containers, and tools. Carefully pour a tiny drizzle of liquid to reach a precise ratio, or quickly mash a root to harvest its essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041890/extras/ee100c242e8712f709e5b027066d404d.poster.avif?t=1762798752\" aria-label=\"A viewing port in a wooden door opens to reveal a creature with a lot of eyeballs.\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041890/extras/ee100c242e8712f709e5b027066d404d.webm?t=1762798752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "You are a journeyman alchemist: experiment to learn the secrets of the alchemical sciences, and leverage them to produce a diverse menu of potions for a procession of weird and spooky customers in this compact narrative puzzle experience.",
